411 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 248 0 R
/E (How might we design a low-cost, solar-powered water quality and equitable distribution monitoring system for rural piped water networks that alerts villagers and authorities to contamination and unfair distribution in real time - using simple visual indicators that require no technical knowledge to understand?)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
